# Git

Full text: `docs/guidelines/git.md`.

- Branch: `<type>/<chunk>-<slug>` (e.g. `feat/B2-session-logging`). No `cursor/...` for ongoing work
- Before non-trivial code: branch name + plan, then wait
- Conventional Commits (`feat(fe):`), one concern; no commit unless asked; no Cursor trailers
- Closing a roadmap chunk → update `WORKBOOK.md`
